00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:04.292
Unit fifteen. Environmental Action!

2
00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:13.267
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Intermediate level!

3
00:00:13.317 --> 00:00:17.751
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:21.667
Today we learn: Environmental Action. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.343 --> 00:00:27.660
Carbon footprint. Say it with me. Carbon footprint!

6
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:35.896
Zero waste. Say it with me. Zero waste!

7
00:00:39.368 --> 00:00:44.335
Renewable resource. Say it with me. Renewable resource!

8
00:00:47.888 --> 00:00:51.988
Activism. Say it with me. Activism!

9
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:01.216
Sustainability goal. Say it with me. Sustainability goal!

10
00:01:04.694 --> 00:01:09.410
Green initiative. Say it with me. Green initiative!

11
00:01:12.915 --> 00:01:17.415
Eco-conscious. Say it with me. Eco-conscious!

12
00:01:20.943 --> 00:01:25.476
Advocacy. Say it with me. Advocacy!

13
00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:32.872
Emission. Say it with me. Emission!

14
00:01:36.370 --> 00:01:40.203
Habitat. Say it with me. Habitat!

15
00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:53.689
Grammar time! Third conditional. Listen. If we had acted sooner, the impact would have been smaller.

16
00:01:53.739 --> 00:02:00.250
Your turn. Say it with me. If we had acted sooner, the impact would have been smaller.

17
00:02:05.114 --> 00:02:17.356
Reducing my carbon footprint through zero waste habits makes a real impact. Youth activism and eco-conscious choices can lead to a strong sustainability goal through advocacy.

18
00:02:17.406 --> 00:02:18.946
I like this story!

19
00:02:19.821 --> 00:02:25.074
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:25.124 --> 00:02:26.793
Renewable resource!

21
00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.099
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:33.149 --> 00:02:34.625
Eco-conscious!

23
00:02:35.882 --> 00:02:45.236
Think and answer. What environmental action would you like to take part in?

24
00:02:45.286 --> 00:02:46.455
Great answer!

25
00:02:47.605 --> 00:02:51.940
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
